# Python apps

- Type hints on all function signatures (PEP8).
- PydanticAI: schema-first `result_type`; inject deps via `deps_type` + `RunContext`.
- Keep business logic out of `entrypoints/` and infra scripts.
- Prefer failing unit/contract tests before implementation when executing a packet.
- Shared code belongs in `modules/lab_shared` only when used by more than one app.
- Run from app dir: `uv run pytest`, `uv run ruff check app/`.
